- Sorting visualizations
- Searching visualizations
- Stack simulator
- Queue simulator
- Algorithm complexity information
- Animation controls
- Responsive interface
- Accessibility support
- Automated testing
- CI/CD
- GitHub Pages deployment

## Local Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```
